import AFTD.Prelude

/-!
# real_hunger_difference_lattice

Topic: combinatorial_games   Node: 951523a24bad

Provenance: formalization of a published result. Source: scout/2610-08949-primitive-periods-in-greedy-chip-firing-games.md:149

The difference lattice L of an n-by-n real matrix P is the set of all real row vectors of the form z * (P - I) for some integer vector z with zero coordinate sum.
-/

/-- The difference lattice generated by rows of P - I with integer zero-sum weights. -/
def real_hunger_difference_lattice {n : ℕ} (P : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) ℝ) : Set (Fin n → ℝ) := { v | ∃ z : Fin n → ℤ, (∑ i, z i = 0) ∧ v = Matrix.vecMul (fun i => (z i : ℝ)) (P - 1) }
